@WorkSphere.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{WorkSphere.API_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Login as L1 CTO (Employee Hierarchy - Organization Scope)
POST {{WorkSphere.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cto@worksphere.com",
  "password": "Cto@12345"
}

