GET {{WorkSphere.API_HostAddress}}/api/rbac/employees
Accept: application/json

### 13. View Configured Multi-Stage Approval Workflows
GET {{WorkSphere.API_HostAddress}}/api/rbac/approval-workflows
Accept: application/json

### 14. View All 22 Company Departments & Subdepartments Hierarchy
GET {{WorkSphere.API_HostAddress}}/api/rbac/departments
Accept: application/json

### 15. View 4-Phase Recruitment & Onboarding Workflow Overview (Employee vs HR Levels)
GET {{WorkSphere.API_HostAddress}}/api/recruitment/workflow-overview
Accept: application/json

### 16. View Job Openings (Synced with External Career Website)
GET {{WorkSphere.API_HostAddress}}/api/recruitment/jobs
Accept: application/json

### 17. View Candidates & 4-Phase Funnel Evaluations
GET {{WorkSphere.API_HostAddress}}/api/recruitment/candidates
Accept: application/json

### 18. Simulate External Career Website Submitting a Candidate Application (Starts Phase 1: Assessment)
POST {{WorkSphere.API_HostAddress}}/api/recruitment/external/apply
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobCode": "JOB-201",
  "fullName": "Rohan Mehra",
  "email": "rohan.mehra@example.com",
  "phone": "+91 99887 76655",
  "experience": "4.5 Years",
  "resumeUrl": "https://careers.worksphere.com/resumes/rohan-mehra.pdf"
}

### 19. View All Request Approval Workflows (Leave, Resignation, Hike/Appraisal, Promotion)
GET {{WorkSphere.API_HostAddress}}/api/requests/workflows
Accept: application/json

### 20. View All Employee Requests with Live Multi-Stage Approval Chains
GET {{WorkSphere.API_HostAddress}}/api/requests
Accept: application/json

### 21. Approve Current Level of Promotion Request (REQ-2026-102)
POST {{WorkSphere.API_HostAddress}}/api/requests/REQ-2026-102/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "remarks": "Approved by CTO at Level 3. Forwarding to HR Manager for Final Grade & Role Elevation."
}

