POST {{WorkSphere.API_HostAddress}}/api/requests/REQ-2026-103/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "remarks": "Salary band verified by Payroll Manager. Forwarding to HR Manager for final sign-off."
}

### 23. My Attendance (Individual Employee Daily Logs & Monthly Summary)
GET {{WorkSphere.API_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/my?employeeCode=EMP-005
Accept: application/json

### 24. Attendance Management (Manager / Department View Across Reporting Lines & Subdepartments)
GET {{WorkSphere.API_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/team?managerCode=EMP-004&departmentCode=ENG
Accept: application/json

### 25. Mark Attendance (Punch In / Punch Out)
POST {{WorkSphere.API_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/mark
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeCode": "EMP-005",
  "action": "PUNCH_IN",
  "location": "17.4482, 78.3742",
  "workMode": "On-site HQ",
  "remarks": "Morning check-in from Hyderabad HQ"
}

### 26. Task Management & My Tasks (List All or Filter by Assignee / Department)
GET {{WorkSphere.API_HostAddress}}/api/tasks?departmentCode=ENG
Accept: application/json

### 27. Assign a New Task to a Team Member (Task Management -> Create Task)
POST {{WorkSphere.API_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Build Real-Time Department Attendance Analytics Widget",
  "description": "Integrate /api/attendance/team endpoint into the Angular Manager Attendance Sheet view.",
  "projectCode": "PRJ-101",
  "assigneeEmployeeCode": "EMP-005",
  "assignedByEmployeeCode": "EMP-004",
  "priority": "High",
  "estimatedHours": 12,
  "category": "Frontend & API",
  "subtasks": [
    "Connect AttendanceService to PostgreSQL API",
    "Add Department & Subdepartment filter dropdown",
    "Verify batch reminder button"
  ]
}

